<http://data.silknow.org/object/701684af-2aa9-3feb-8e4e-9c38883426c7>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "White cotton warp and weft with heavier cotton wefts used for body and, where required, for looped pattern.  Large eight-pointed star in center surrounded by conventionalized tulips and star-shaped flowers.  Around this, a wide border composed of eight-armed units made of conventionalized tulips and trees.  Several rectilinear borders beyond this decorated with conventionalized roses and eight-pointed stars, diamonds and crosses.  Edged with white cotton tape.  Worn and darned.  Cotton browned.  Three brown stains."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/4555317a-df2d-35db-8ffe-8e78fbd27510> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "White cotton warp and weft with heavier cotton wefts used for body and, where required, for looped pattern.  Large eight-pointed star in center surrounded by conventionalized tulips and star-shaped flowers.  Around this, a wide border composed of eight-armed units made of conventionalized tulips and trees.  Several rectilinear borders beyond this decorated with conventionalized roses and eight-pointed stars, diamonds and crosses.  Edged with white cotton tape.  Worn and darned.  Cotton browned.  Three brown stains."@en ;
